,{"id":5620706,"name":"Roman Kravtsov"},{"id":2468526,"name":"Irina Spiridonova","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c13IQKW42SsJwF1yMEfCoYimfoy.jpg"},{"id":1142249,"name":"Anna Kotova","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i13TLKMUM9UCAabyJ02fnP2o1vh.jpg"},{"id":2404537,"name":"Sergey Kosov"},{"id":2366448,"name":"Elena Tretyakova"},{"id":5695551,"name":"Konstantin Belskiy"},{"id":4421767,"name":"Dilnara Anarkulova","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7LzMoptwzHjiwCIjXG31TzVYhLz.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Escort Girl","overview":"Christina lavora come organizzatrice di mostre d'arte moderna, ma in realtà organizza intrattenimento per clienti facoltosi nei luoghi più esotici. Decine di ragazze d'élite da tutto il mondo lavorano per lei. In passato, Christina ha anche lavorato come hostess a tali feste, ma, essendo molto ambiziosa, qualche anno fa ha cambiato completamente la sua immagine ed è diventata una manager di classe extra. Ma questo lavoro ha anche un lato negativo: la presenza costante di criminalità, polizia e servizi speciali, così come interruzioni e intrighi di ragazze che cercano di strappare una fetta più grande della torta."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Escort Girl","overview":"Kristina runs a front for an illegal operation involving numerous women, masquerading as an art exhibition organizer while evading law enforcement scrutiny through her global events for wealthy clientele."},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Кристина — организатор выставок современного искусства, на деле же она организует развлечения для богатых клиентов в самых экзотических местах. На нее работают десятки элитных девушек со всего мира. Когда-то в прошлом Кристина тоже работала хостес на подобных вечеринках, но, будучи очень амбициозной, несколько лет назад полностью сменила имидж и стала менеджером экстра-класса. Но у этой работы есть и обратная сторона — постоянное присутствие криминала, полиции и спецслужб, а также срывы и интриги девушек, пытающихся оторвать кусок пирога побольше.","tagline":"«Чтобы спасти жизни близких, ей придется выбрать правильный путь»"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/skcRqznoemfLTWoVVV23ieDKULT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/skcRqznoemfLTWoVVV23ieDKULT.png","language":"ru","width":1920,"height":347}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x8pmWBc2qqu5sH7g5am1KxGHycx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x8pmWBc2qqu5sH7g5am1KxGHycx.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kNOM8pEiYFoCIOcrORbr5nDwrNH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kNOM8pEiYFoCIOcrORbr5nDwrNH.jpg","language":"en","width":1124,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2bJAvNFrag6aIGvDOtVLdeMI3QS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2bJAvNFrag6aIGvDOtVLdeMI3QS.jpg","language":"en","width":1067,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jXfKXf8vUeQyNVXCmIVUzzRpHPK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jXfKXf8vUeQyNVXCmIVUzzRpHPK.jpg","language":"ru","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ihfhz0cBEUwrq26oHh3xhkQNH5g.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ihfhz0cBEUwrq26oHh3xhkQNH5g.jpg","language":"ru","width":900,"height":1280},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gZKxyBnYoZWnz0RKEwOcRbfVKVS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gZKxyBnYoZWnz0RKEwOcRbfVKVS.jpg","language":"ru","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l2BVPDNaziGV2pi5HvF1fhLem0X.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l2BVPDNaziGV2pi5HvF1fhLem0X.jpg","language":"ru","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.o